title: item:delete
tags: [[GUI command]] Trash
kind: reference
summary: Delete what is designated: its file to the trash, or the metarecord without a file (selection / query)

The Delete key ([[Deleting an item]]). With no argument, the item under the
cursor: its file goes to the trash, its metarecords with it; a metarecord
without a file is deleted. `item:delete selection` does it to the checked
metarecords, `item:delete query` to what the [[metarecord-list panel]] shows.
It asks nothing — nothing it does is final — and does nothing without an
active repository, where there would be no trash to restore from.
